             PGM
/*   SET ITONLY JCW (257) TO 1 SO USER CAN ONLY WORK WITH     */
/*   INTERNAL ORDERS WITHIN THE PO PROGRAM TPURORD            */
             CHGDTAARA  DTAARA(*LDA (257 1)) VALUE('1')
             CALL TPURORD
             CHGDTAARA  DTAARA(*LDA (257 1)) VALUE(' ')
             ENDPGM
